This looks like you are trying to launch an app on one system and have it display on
another system - possibly an Xstation or a PC with an X server?  At any rate, the
system that is trying to run the Frameviewer program is not authorized to connect to
your server.  Try running the command 

xhost <hostname>

on your server system where <hostname> is the host that the Frameviewer runs on, not
your Xserver system.  If this fixes the problem you can make it permanent by adding
the host name to the file /etc/X0.hosts or whatever the equivalent is on your
system. 
Good Luck
	/dwight
