Why stop there?  We'll all be walking around with vocoders that blank
our speech when we say something rude, with earphones that block our
ears when indecent sounds are received and shutters before our eyes when
there's something indecent to see.  If touch and smell are included as
well, we'll be wearing harnesses and noseplugs.

When that happens we'll probably all be speaking Newspeak (the term
'political correctness' didn't exist yet in 1948...).

Note the follow-ups.

