hi,

I am using an Alphaserver 2100 4/275 which has 1 gb memory,
1 21064 CPU. OS is Digital UNIX v3.2c.  I found that P1003.1b
named semaphore operations (sem_create, sem_wait, sem_post) are 
faster than System V implementation (semget,semop). The following
is the result of pure semaphore acquire and release operations 
(at test time, the system load is very low, actually, only myself 
was using the machine):

iterations   Posix      Sys V
